 "about": "Module layer map: the named modules each console page must show (checked in a browser by the scratch module_health.mjs at 1440 and 393) and the JSX file that owns each. tests/frontend_module_layer.mjs checks it statically. A name is the tg-mod--/tg-block-- modifier, else data-testid, else id, else the first non-tg class; marker is used when the test id is built at runtime. v3 (MX4): allowlist with unique keys. module_elements = the only elements that may carry tg-mod/tg-block/tg-box/tg-lift; focus_elements = the only elements that may carry tabIndex or tg-lift (raw value pinned). Key = tag + data-testid, else className without module tokens, else id; a key shared by twins in one file ends in #n/total (document order). Each key appears once. The guard trusts the map committed at its base commit; a different map needs --registry-change <sha256> after review.",
